  ('editorial','Formulated with purpose',true,70,'{"eyebrow":"Our approach","title":"Say what''s inside.|Say how much.","text":"Formula 5 starts with a simple idea: every product has one hero active, and its percentage is stated in the name. Precision in the formula. Purity in the presentation. Performance you can judge for yourself.","cta_text":"Read our story","link":"/our-story","accent":"#A9C2A2","art":"glow-boost-face-wash,hair-growth-oil,lip-repair-elixir","image":""}'::jsonb),
